Actors Tom Hiddleston, Willem Dafoe and Genden Phuntsok joined the other cast and crew of “Tenzing” for the film’s London premiere. &quot;It's a privilege and an honor to carry the responsibility of playing Edmund Hillary in the story,&quot; actor Tom Hiddleston said. Actor Genden Phuntsok said &quot;we didn't really film in the mountain, on the Mount Everest because this is too high.&quot;
